# Xcode's build-system scratch directory. `make clean` removes it; nothing in
# it is source.
.build/

# Skill mounts, which Codenotch writes into a project it manages.
#
# They are absolute symlinks into whoever's `~/.codenotch/skills` — this repo
# is one of the projects the app under development is pointed at, so they
# appear here as a side effect of using it. Committed, they would land in a
# clone as links to a home directory that does not exist there.
.agents/
.claude/skills
